.TH SYS_PROC_COUNT 2 "March 2026" "Substrate" "System Calls Manual"
.SH NAME
sys_proc_count \- return active process count
.SH LIBRARY
System library (libsys, \-lsys)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <sys/sysinfo.h>
.PP
.BI "int sys_proc_count(void);"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR sys_proc_count ()
returns the number of active process-table entries as seen by the kernel.
.SH RETURN VALUE
On success, a non-negative process count is returned.
.SH ERRORS
This call currently has no documented error path.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sys_proc_list (2),
.BR sys_proc_info (2),
.BR sys_cpu_count (2)
